


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_c695b7e8:



    voice "2HI_0256"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_f301287c:


    "阳菜回来了。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_e81581f3:


    "但她的表情很难看，脸上写满了不高兴。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_053ed6cb:


    "不一会，伦也回到了房间。她有些喘不上气。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_45d5dfbf:



    voice "2RI_0240"
    rin "「因为你突然跑掉了啊。我怎么可能追得上你啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_d47a1912:


    "阳菜并没有回头。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_5f4a94eb:



    voice "2RI_0241"
    rin "「阳菜——」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_6ad5a5c0:



    voice "2HI_0257"
    hina "「我不要理伦了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_dae1bdbc:


    "阳菜喊道。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_3c5ca2f8:



    voice "2RI_0242"
    rin "「诶？怎、怎么生气了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_06faae78:


    "伦这才发现阳菜心情不好。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_47a3a098:


    "伦绕到阳菜正面，抓住她的肩膀；但阳菜还是低着头，不愿与伦对视。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_4b73503c:



    voice "2RI_0243"
    rin "「……我做了什么事情吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_b6cf5635:



    voice "2HI_0258"
    hina "「………………」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_cda483de:



    voice "2RI_0244"
    rin "「……你不说我怎么知道嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_bafc788b:



    voice "2HI_0259"
    hina "「……你真的不知道？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_a0593521:


    "伦战战兢兢地点点头。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_9eb381f9:



    voice "2HI_0260"
    hina "「……唉」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_a326fe1b:


    "阳菜长叹一口气，肩膀塌了下来。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_eca7bc3c:



    voice "2RI_0245"
    rin "「诶、怎么……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_1fa5057b:



    voice "2HI_0261"
    hina "「我抱过去的时候，你却突然把我推开了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_01a5caa8:


    "伦立刻回想起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_b21daaf9:



    voice "2RI_0246"
    rin "「没、没有推开那么夸张吧……那个、只是稍微拉开一点距离」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_97563770:



    voice "2HI_0262"
    hina "「为什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_9badebdc:



    voice "2RI_0247"
    rin "「这、这是……因为迎面有同学走过来」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_70ac4479:



    voice "2HI_0263"
    hina "「我知道。我也看到了。就因为这件事？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_083254ed:



    voice "2RI_0248"
    rin "「因为……一起回去什么的，被朋友传谣言的话会很羞耻的啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_5ceb667d:



    voice "2HI_0264"
    hina "「……和我在一起是一件羞耻的事？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_2376590f:



    voice "2RI_0249"
    rin "「……抱歉」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_39a464f0:


    "伦发现自己越抹越黑，老实改口道歉。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_742a62ea:



    voice "2HI_0265"
    hina "「算了。伦不是有恶意，只是神经太大条了，一直都是……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_d8cb467f:



    voice "2RI_0250"
    rin "「呜……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_b0e96863:


    "伦把反驳咽回肚子。她也知道现在气氛不妙。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_7c71b558:



    voice "2RI_0251"
    rin "「……等下怎么办？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_dc181b14:



    voice "2HI_0266"
    hina "「我要整理照片」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_117864f3:



    voice "2RI_0252"
    rin "「诶、那我呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_63b666a8:



    voice "2HI_0267"
    hina "「看你的小黄书呗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_a09b1056:


    "阳菜漠不关心。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_83121edf:



    voice "2RI_0253"
    rin "「这是浅生好心给我们制造的二人时间啊？岂不是太浪费了！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_6647c6f9:



    voice "2HI_0268"
    hina "「你好烦啊。我没那个心情！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_946b9fa4:



    voice "2RI_0254"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_ae2b1116:


    "阳菜愤愤地扭过了头，伦就这样被晾在了一边。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_6448139e:



    voice "2RI_0255"
    rin "「小——阳——菜！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_a28dcbd3:



    voice "2HI_0269"
    hina "「呜哇！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_883da2ba:


    "伦从阳菜身后飞扑过去。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_3b21994c:



    voice "2RI_0256"
    rin "「我们和好吧！我可是很期待二人时间的」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_0497f92d:



    voice "2HI_0270"
    hina "「我也很期待啊！都怪伦！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_9e799baa:



    voice "2RI_0257"
    rin "「我不是道歉了嘛！不够的话我就继续道歉！对不起对不起！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_a072d8a9:



    voice "2HI_0271"
    hina "「放、放开我！我讨厌这样的伦！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_1e0e2caa:



    voice "2RI_0258"
    rin "「别说讨厌了。真的很伤人！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_4c8c111f:


    "伦努力压住暴动的阳菜。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_6cb9875e:


    "两人势均力敌。伦在体格上有着压倒性的优势，但阳菜的身体能力也不是盖的。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_1009935c:



    voice "2RI_0259B2"
    rin "「唔唔唔……看、看招！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_ca5b1d65:


    "伦朝暴动的阳菜耳边吹了口气。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_2e9925cc:



    voice "2HI_0272"
    hina "「呜啊啊！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_9cf8686d:


    "阳菜立刻失去了抵抗的力气。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_278c7e29:


    "………………"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_0fd4d656:


    "…………"
